---
/**
 * Home page for the zh-TW locale root (`/zh-TW`).
 *
 * `/zh-TW` would otherwise be captured by `[...locale]/[slug].astro` as a page
 * slug, so each non-default locale needs this one static entry. Every other
 * route is shared through `[...locale]/`. Adding a locale: copy this folder.
 */
import HomePage from "../../components/HomePage.astro";
---

<HomePage locale="zh-TW" />
